 "Evaporative cooling. Google reports ≈ 1 L/kWh fleet-wide; air-cooled sites ≈ 0.": "Pendinginan evaporatif. Google melaporkan ≈ 1 L/kWh di seluruh pusat datanya; lokasi berpendingin udara ≈ 0.",
 "Every number is derived live from the sliders.": "Setiap angka dihitung langsung dari slider.",
 "Every tonne removed by direct air capture at today's Frontier offtake price. Ground +48 %, orbit +8 %; still ~1.6× (1.64× on the plain bill) — you cannot buy your way to parity (that needs ≈$4 200/t before time, ≈$3 700/t with it). The Planet's verdict is retired; the argument is now purely a bill.": "Setiap ton dihilangkan lewat penangkapan udara langsung dengan harga offtake Frontier saat ini. Darat +48 %, orbit +8 %; masih ~1,6× (1,64× pada tagihan murni) — kesetaraan tak bisa dibeli (itu butuh ≈$4 200/t sebelum waktu dihitung, ≈$3 700/t bila dihitung). Putusan Planet gugur; perdebatannya kini murni soal tagihan.",
 "Everything goes right: $100/kg, $300/kg bus, 10-year life, dawn-dusk orbit, 300 W/kg arrays, 4 kg/kW hardware, 105 °C chips, 3 %/yr failures, 6 % capital. ~0.7× ground: the plain bill is 0.8×, and a light fleet is up in 2.5 yr against ground's 3.5-year queue.": "Semuanya berjalan mulus: $100/kg, bus $300/kg, umur 10 tahun, orbit fajar-senja, panel surya 300 W/kg, perangkat keras 4 kg/kW, chip 105 °C, kegagalan 3 %/thn, modal 6 %. ~0,7× darat: tagihan murninya 0,8×, dan armada yang ringan sudah beroperasi dalam 2,5 thn, sementara antrean di darat 3,5 tahun.",
 "Expensive ground — $0.20/kWh, $20k/kW facility": "Darat mahal — $0,20/kWh, fasilitas $20 ribu/kW",
